<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} suggests doing a little binge party. Be warned - Binge parties can last up to a few hours. Colonists will binge on food and drugs until it is over. Simply draft your colonists to stop them taking part in the binge party.-->
  <VSIE_BingeParty.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}建议大家办个狂欢聚会。要注意的是，狂欢聚会可能会持续几个小时。殖民者会狂吃食物和成瘾品直到聚会结束。简单地征召殖民者可以阻止他们参与狂欢聚会。</VSIE_BingeParty.letterText>
  <!--EN: birthday-->
  <VSIE_BirthdayParty.label>生日</VSIE_BirthdayParty.label>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} is throwing a birthday party! Everyone who goes will gain recreation and social energy, and a lasting positive mood boost.-->
  <VSIE_BirthdayParty.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}正在举办他/她的生日聚会！每个参加聚会的人都能得到娱乐和社交满意度，还能获得持续的心情增益。</VSIE_BirthdayParty.letterText>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} is building snowmen with {COMPANION_labelShort}.-->
  <VSIE_BuildingSnowmen.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}正邀请{COMPANION_labelShort}共同堆雪人。</VSIE_BuildingSnowmen.letterText>
  <!--EN: Colonists gather over the {DEADPAWN_labelShort}'s grave to honor {DEADPAWN_possessive} memory.-->
  <VSIE_Funeral.letterText>殖民者在{DEADPAWN_labelShort}的坟墓旁聚集，以缅怀{DEADPAWN_possessive}。</VSIE_Funeral.letterText>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} is going for a walk with {COMPANION_labelShort}.-->
  <VSIE_GoingForAWalk.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}正邀请{COMPANION_labelShort}共同散步。</VSIE_GoingForAWalk.letterText>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} is grabbing a beer with {COMPANION_labelShort}.-->
  <VSIE_GrabbingBeer.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}正邀请{COMPANION_labelShort}共同开怀畅饮。</VSIE_GrabbingBeer.letterText>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} having a romantic meal with {COMPANION_labelShort}.-->
  <VSIE_MealTogether.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}正邀请{COMPANION_labelShort}共同进餐。</VSIE_MealTogether.letterText>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} is having a movie night with {COMPANION_labelShort}.-->
  <VSIE_MovieNight.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}正邀请{COMPANION_labelShort}共度精彩的电影之夜。</VSIE_MovieNight.letterText>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} suggests having an outdoors party. Colonists will go outdoors and have a campfire, and then sit around it and talk.-->
  <VSIE_OutdoorParty.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}建议举办一个户外聚会。殖民者们会走到户外搭起篝火，然后围坐在一起畅谈。</VSIE_OutdoorParty.letterText>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} is skygazing with {COMPANION_labelShort}.-->
  <VSIE_Skygazing.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}正邀请{COMPANION_labelShort}共同仰望苍穹。</VSIE_Skygazing.letterText>
  <!--EN: {ORGANIZER_labelShort} is viewing art with {COMPANION_labelShort}.-->
  <VSIE_ViewingArtTogether.letterText>{ORGANIZER_labelShort}正邀请{COMPANION_labelShort}共同欣赏艺术。</VSIE_ViewingArtTogether.letterText>
